Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifth Episode\NThe Monsters of the Three Vallies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying this rose is poisonous?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed. My wife pricked her finger on a thorn...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then she danced for three days until she died from it. Poor little wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.26,0:02:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And how is it there are two coffins?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, my son is in the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.06,0:02:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The only antidote to the rose's poison...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...is an herb found in the Three Valleys...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...and my son had gone right down there to look for this herb!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He had the courage to go there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that there are monsters in the Three Valleys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he was surprised by one of them at the entrance to the first valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster wounded him and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!\NDon't you know that roses have thorns?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, mother!\NI picked it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Every morning you give me a rose. How sweet you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you one every morning until your birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What color do you want tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- I would like a red rose.\N- I will bring it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Be careful!\N- Don't worry, mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A red rose, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in sight! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get rid of all the red roses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And now... I will leave in the rose\Ngarden only this one, in plain sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only one and\NSapphire cannot help but pick it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But this one is poisoned..\N.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful morning! I will go\Nimmediately to pick a rose for my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look at that squirrel!\N- Let's play a trick on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Sapphire is down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the last moments of\Nhappiness for you, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You will die as soon as you\Ntouch a thorn of the red rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a magnificent rose!\N- No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it!\NDon't pick it, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!\NAren't you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fly away! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, please!\NLet's play together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, little birds! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning I want to\Npick it myself for Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Stop! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong, Baron Nylon,\Nthat you look at me this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you, Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange energy\Ncompels me to dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! Sapphire was supposed to prick\Nherself and the Queen pricked herself instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen now? That poison\Ntakes effect immediately and is deadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me stop!\NPlease!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop anymore! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is the matter?\N- My feet are dragging me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.34,0:06:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand: she pricked\Nherself with a poisonous flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tragedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Tell me, what is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I didn't expect it\Nto be the Queen herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...to prick herself\Nwith that poisonous rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?\NShe will only live for three days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Prince.\NWe are dismayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Her fever is too high.\N- It will take her straight to the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Courtiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a medicine to cure her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The only remedy is to put\Na specific herb on the wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, go gather\Nthis herb and bring it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry, Prince, but the herb\Ngrows in the Three Valleys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...and whoever went down there\Nhas never returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't happen to be that place where rumors\Nsay some monsters live?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, that's the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will order someone\Nto go there immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.70,0:07:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- I order you to go there!\N- But I'm afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward! Are you afraid of monsters?\NThen, you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Prince,\Nmy wife is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- And you? - I have children!\NIf I die, what will become of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- You!\N- I don't feel very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cowards! Alright,\Nthen I will go myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent! I still get\Nwhat I was hoping for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sapphire goes down there, she\Nwill be devoured by the monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow anything to\Nhappen to the Crown Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will go!\N- Wait, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let a faithful\NGeneral of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...go there at\Nthe risk of his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's young soldiers\Nare nothing but weaklings!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am forced to go myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- May heaven protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Is it true that the Queen\Npricked herself with a poisonous rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! And now I'm going to the Three Valleys\Nto pick the herb that will cure her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Sapphire went alone?!\NBut it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, immediately send\Nsome soldiers to help him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...and choose the strongest!\N- Yes, yes, Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I sent\Nthe weakest soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, Opal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the florist! I recognize him!\NWhat is he doing in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I injured my leg\Nand I can no longer walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the fault of that cursed monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you attacked by the monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I fell on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to try\Nto avenge my son's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Injured like that, you won't succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I will avenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this waterskin of water,\NHighness! It will help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What should I do with it?\N- Legend says...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...that the monster of the first valley\Nmust be confronted...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,.With water, not with the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I suffer from vertigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They are tongues of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Courage! Let's go!\NCourage! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't do anything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hurt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, look over there!\N- He's already taken the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- He saw us!\N- Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hot! Good\Nheavens, I'm burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster of the first\Nvalley must be faced...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...with water, not\Nwith the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, water! I'll\Nsplash it with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible! The\Nwater is killing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Something came out of its mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The first day is about to\Nend. I only have two days...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...before my mother dies\Nexhausted, poisoned by the venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must get past the other\Ntwo monsters. I must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take this with me.\NIt will give me light!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, dear!\NWhere are you, my little one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to see you before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Poor Queen!\N- She will still live...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,..only two days!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Queen!\NWho knows if Sapphire will make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature is dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But they are icicles!\NI'm starting to feel cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.14,0:14:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I have the fire, otherwise\NI would risk freezing to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sleepy, but I must try\Nnot to fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My time has never been\Nso precious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening to me?\NWhy am I so sleepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A day and a half has already passed!\NIf Sapphire doesn't return by tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- my dear wife will die!\N- Sapphire will be killed by the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could Sapphire be?\NIn the second valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where the Three Valleys are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you take me there, dear friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep\Nand it's past noon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the monster of the second valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword!\NJust a little more effort!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'm finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink, give me the fire!\N- Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to defeat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still have to get past\Nthe last monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the one in the third valley.\NLet's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, great eagle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a little piece\Nof the monster's tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think\Nit could be useful to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's so cold!\NIt's colder than ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it in my sword's scabbard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, great eagle!\N- Goodbye, friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to come with us?\N- Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what\Nthe monster of the third valley will be like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire, did you see?\N- They have no way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you see that grass over there?\N- It must be the herb we are looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How will we reach it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's cross the swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- But it's terrifying!\N- We have no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how deep\Nthis muddy water is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.14,0:19:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get to the\Ngrass! We can't stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us could make it all\Nthe way down there, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you two like to go\Nto get the grass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel up to\Ncrossing the swamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, yes, of course!\N- Thank you, little birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! These are the\Nmonsters of the third valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I must reach that grass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.22,0:20:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on, Tink!\N- Sapphire, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save me, Sapphire! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Tink! I will save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it! The water\Nis too cold for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I will use the little piece of\Nthe tail of the ice monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They are freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They have frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, how cold\Nthis icy water is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better skate!\NWe'll move faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be enough!\NLet's go back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens,\Ntoday is the third day!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be back at the\Npalace before the sun sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We can ask the robins to\Nbring the herb to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Little friends, do you\Nfeel up to flying to the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! Pour the herb juice\Non the Queen's wound! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! The life of my\Nmother depends on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire will not return.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord, please!\NLet my wife be saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there at least some hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.70,0:23:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you all standing\Npetrified staring at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.90,0:23:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was saying that he returned safe\Nand sound with the herb, that bastard...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dear Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not dead, damn him! I'm\Ngoing crazy! I'll never get rid of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must succeed! I must\Nsucceed! I must! I must!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.58,0:23:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see? He must have gone\Ncrazy with joy over your recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hooray!\N- Long live the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you make it in time?\N- Yes, the Queen is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.86,0:24:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a relief!\N- We made it, mom!
